        "candidate_id": "C_edcae09c250fc53b_0",
        "edit": "Fix malformed binary literals in the 3-to-8 decoder case statements: 3'b100 was 8'b0001_000 (7 bits) and 3'b111 was 8'b100_0000 (7 bits), causing incorrect output values. Corrected to 8'b0001_0000 and 8'b1000_0000 respectively.",
